.TH quotadial-licence-add 1  "QuotaDial 0.2.0" QuotaDial
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
quotadial\-licence\-add \- Add a licence key for QuotaDial Pro, which replaces any kept before
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquotadial licence add\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIKEY\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a licence key for QuotaDial Pro, which replaces any kept before
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIKEY\fR]
The key, which starts with QD1. Leave it out to paste it when asked, or to pipe it in
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH "SEE ALSO"
quotadial(1). The full guide is docs/CLI.md in QuotaDial\*(Aqs repository, https://github.com/pghmatt/quotadial, and quotadial.com.
